 {
  "text": "Hi Rodrigo, it is Nora. Tomorrow at lunch you meet Sarah, from the lab. She is new in the team, and she is very friendly. She is tall, with long red hair and glasses. She is young, but she is very good at her job. The restaurant is small, and it is a little crowded at one o'clock. So look for a tall woman with red hair, at a table next to the window. Have a nice lunch!",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a16_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Welcome to the West Village. This part of New York is old and very beautiful. The streets are small and quiet, with tall trees and red houses. It is not like Midtown: there are no tall glass buildings here. On the weekend it is crowded, with a lot of tourists, but on a Tuesday morning it is calm. There are many small restaurants and nice cafes. It is a great place for a long walk.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a16_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Nora opened the team page on her computer. First she showed Rodrigo a photo of Claire, the tall director from Paris. Then she talked about Tom, a funny man with a modern plant. Rodrigo asked about her office in a tall glass building. At the end Nora asked him about Sorocaba and his team.",
  "voice": "arthur",
